          "text": "<h2><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Is your current practice adding unnecessary costs?</span> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">A nationwide survey of 30 hospitals using a competitive female external urine collection device revealed additional “hidden” costs that impact workflow and finances.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n",
