          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">PrimaFit</span> External Urine Management for the Female Anatomy (for adults and adolescents)</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Contours to patient anatomy </b>and maintains shape&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Gentle adhesive pad</b> keeps the device in place&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Can be left in place</b>&nbsp;for 12-24 hours&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/sage/products/sage-primafit.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn more</span></a></p>\n",
