          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">PrimoFit Flow</span>&nbsp;External Urine Management for the Male Anatomy (for adults and adolescents)</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Customizable fit</b> eliminates the need for sizing charts</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Stays in place</b> with adhesive pad and base adhesive</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Can be left in place</b> for up to 24 hours</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/sage/products/sage-primofit.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn more</span></a></p>\n",
